</lotusscript></code><code event="xSDSCS_xVarCSCo_Client"><lotusscript>Function xSDSCS_xVarCSCo_Client(ByVal p_Cle As Variant, ByVal p_NomVar As String, ByVal p_ValeurNulle As Variant, _
